        "description": {
            "value": "<p>You open the road and hold it open, and everything already dying goes down it.</p><p>Each enemy in the emanation that is at or below half its maximum Hit Points must attempt a Fortitude save.</p><p><strong>Success</strong> The creature is unaffected.</p><p><strong>Failure</strong> The creature takes @Damage[(10+@item.level)d6[void]] damage.</p><p><strong>Critical Failure</strong> The creature dies.</p><hr /><p><strong>Heightened (+1)</strong> The damage increases by 1d6.</p><hr /><p>Granted by the Cancer Zenith Boon, <strong>once per Zenith day</strong>. This is a rank-9 nova on a once-a-day leash, deliberately: the earlier draft fired every round and beat <em>massacre</em>.</p>"
